#AREA Landover~
#AUTHORS Jaxom  ~





#HELPS
-1 LANDOVER_CHANGES~
12.25.04 - Changed line in mob 15021 from mpoload i15024 to
           mpoload 15024 to stop bug message received when tarnished
           equip quest was done. (Mag)
12.25.04 - 36 spelling errors corrected. (Mag)
~

-1 LANDOVER_EXTERNALS~
LANDOVER EXTERNALS
There are external bmp files on some of the quest objects in
the area, so take a look at em when you get the chance.~


-1 LANDOVER~
LANDOVER
The magic kingdom of Landover is based on the series by Terry Brooks.
Twenty years ago,  The king of Landover died leaving his son, Michael as
his only heir.  Unfortunately for the kingdom, Michael did not want the
kingdom.  He conspired with the then Court Wizard, Meeks, to help him get
out of his kingdom, but he did not want to be penniless wherever he
ended up, so they planned to sell the throne to the highest bidder.
You enter the scene thirty-two kings later.
.
.      (A) Externals
.      (B) Jaxom
.
Last updated July 30, 1998


{a}LANDOVER_EXTERNALS
{b}JAXOM
~
0 $~




#RANGES 10 40 0 99
#FLAGS AFLAG_NODEBUG|AFLAG_NOTELEPORT
#MOBILES
#15000
rosen shopkeeper man~
Rosen the Shopkeeper~
Rosen the Shopkeeper sits at the counter.~
He doesn't look like a guy that would own a store, but what do you know?~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND
0 S
1 BODY_HAND BODY_HAND 10d10+10000 1d10+90
10000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_RESTING POS_RESTING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 50~
say Good afternoon,  can I interest you in anything?
~
>speech_prog yes~
say Good, Good.
smile 
say I suggest you buy a wishbook to help determine 
say what you would like to buy.
mpforce $n list
~
>speech_prog challenge~
mpmset $n quest 5 4 0
say You had better go defend your kingdom then.
~
|
#15001
meeks old man~
Meeks~
An old man sits at the desk waiting for you.~
He may look old, but you guess that you wouldn't want to tangle with him.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND
0 S
95 BODY_HAND BODY_HAND 10d10+8500 1d10+75
10000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_RESTING POS_RESTING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 50~
if quest(0, 4, $n) == 0
  mpechoat $n Meeks stands up and shakes your hand before sitting back down.
  say What can I do for you?
endif
~
>bribe_prog 100000~
if iskiller($n)
  say I am sorry but you are unsuitable for this purchase.
  say Here is your money back.
  mpmadd $n gold 100000
else
 if quest(0, 4, $n) == 0
  mpjunk all
  mpoload 15000
  give i15000 $n
  say You won't regret this purchase.  To go to Landover,
  say just wear the medallion and think Landover.
  say If you ever wish to leave Landover, just remove
  say the medallion and think of home.
  mpmset $n quest 0 4 1
 else
  say I am sorry but you are unsuitable for this purchase.
  say Here is your money back.
  mpmadd $n gold 100000
 endif
endif
mpjunk all
~
>give_prog I15000~
mpjunk all
say I'm sorry that you did not like Landover.
say Maybe you can come again?
mpmset $n quest 0 4 0
~
>speech_prog landover~
say You are interested in the special purchase called
say Landover?  Just give me one hundred thousand gold
say coins and the kingdom is yours.
mpmset $n quest 0 4 0
mpmset $n quest 5 4 0
~
|
#15002
themarkquestmob mark iron demon~
The Mark~
The Iron Mark charges you!~
He is at least eight feet tall.  Serrated spines run the length
of his limbs and back, and bright crimson eyes shine through his
death's head helmet.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE|ACT_ONE_FIGHT
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_PASS_DOOR|AFF_TONGUES
-1000 S
30 BODY_HEAD BODY_HAND|BODY_FOOT 10d10+500 1d10+20
34297 RACE_DROW
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>death_prog 100~
if quest(0, 4, $n) == 10
  mpecho The Mark screams as the death blow is dealt.
  mpechoat $n Your head spins as the enormity of your situation sinks in.
  mpechoat $n The medallion of the king of Landover has let you become the
  mpechoat $n the Paladin and defeat the mark!  You know that from now on you
  mpechoat $n will always have a part of the Paladin within you.
  mpmset $n quest 0 4 11
  mpquiet on
  mpoload 15025
  give i15025 $n
  mpoload 15026
  give i15026 $n
  mpoload 15027
  give i15027 $n
  mpoload 15028
  give i15028 $n
  mpquiet off
endif
~
