#15003
parsnip kobold~
Parsnip the Kobold~
Parsnip the Kobold stands here waiting to serve dinner.~
He looks like half monkey, half porcupine.  His ears are reminiscent
of Dumbo and his toes are prehensile.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS
0 S
50 BODY_HEAD BODY_HAND|BODY_FOOT 10d10+1300 1d10+35
100000 RACE_DROW
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 50~
if actorhasobjnum(15000)
  if quest(0, 4, $n) == 12
    mpechoat $n Parsnip hisses at you happily.
  endif
else
  if quest(0, 4, $n) == 0
    if quest(13, 1, $n) == 1
      mpechoat $n Parsnip hisses at you angrily.
      mpkill $n
    endif
    mpechoat $n Parsnip hisses at you angrily.
    mpmset $n quest 13 1 1
    mptransfer $n 15075
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog restart~
mpmset $n quest 5 4 0
snicker 
~
>rand_prog 10~
mpecho Parsnip grins at you showing all his needle sharp teeth.
~
>rand_prog 20~
mpecho Parsnip gestures trying to ask if you want something to eat.
~
