#15008
strabo dragon~
Strabo~
Strabo the Dragon eyes you hungrily.~
He looks like most dragons, large, mean and hungry.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_FLYING|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
50 BODY_HEAD 0 10d10+1300 1d10+35
92323 RACE_DROW
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>death_prog 100~
if class($n) == 4
  if level($n) < 45
    mpoload 15033
  endif
endif
~
>all_greet_prog 100~
if quest(0, 4, $n) == 7
  say What do you want with me play-king?
  say I should roast you for daring to enter my domain.
else
  if quest(0, 4, $n) > 7
    shout You will die, $n, for what you did to me!
    mpecho The Dragon attacks!
    mpkill $n
  else
    say You will die for entering my domain!
    mpecho The Dragon attacks!
    mpkill $n
  endif
endif
~
>give_prog i15004~
if quest(0,4,$n)==7
  mpechoat $n Strabo inhales in surprise as he sees what have given him.
  mpechoat $n Unfortunately for him, this means he gets a full dose of the
  mpechoat $n Io Dust. While he is under it's influence, you quickly persuade
  mpechoat $n him to bow to you as king and even manage to talk him into
  mpechoat $n taking you back to nightshade.
  mpechoat $n You climb onto Strabo's back and before you know it you are at 
  mpechoat $n Deep Fell. As Soon as you dismount, Strabo takes off and disappears
  mpechoat $n into the east.
  mpechoaround $n $n throws some dust into Strabo's face and then has a brief and
  mpechoaround $n peculiar conversation with him. Afterwards, they seem to be best
  mpechoaround $n friends and $n climbs onto Strabo's back and they fly into the
  mpechoaround $n west. After a few moments, Strabo returns alone.
  mpmset $n quest 0 4 8
  mptransfer $n 15028
  mpjunk i15004
endif
~
|
#15009
questor thews wizard~
Questor~
Questor Thews, Court Wizard stands here.~
He is very thin.  His eyebrows are large and bushy and when he looks
at you he looks a bit like an owl.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE|ACT_PRACTICE|ACT_TRAIN
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
40 BODY_HEAD BODY_HAND 10d10+600 1d10+30
10000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if actorhasobjnum(15000)
  if rand(10)
    mpechoat $n Questor attempts to conjure a piece of fruit for you.
    mpechoat $n Questor mumbles a few words and waves his hands about.
    mpquiet on
    cast 'control weather' worse
    cast 'control weather' worse 
    cast 'control weather' worse 
    cast 'control weather' worse 
    cast 'control weather' worse 
    mpquiet off
    mpechoat $n A piece of fruit doesn't appear, but it does start to rain.
  else
    if rand(10)
      mpechoat $n Questor tries to cast a spell of protection on you.
      mpechoat $n Questor mumbles a few words and waves his hands about.
      mpquiet on
      cast 'change sex' $n
      mpquiet off
      mpechoat $n Nothing happens.  Or did it?
    endif
  endif
else
  say I see you have gotten rid of your medallion
  say thus relinquishing your rule of Landover.
  say Very well.  Return to Meeks!
  mpmset $n quest 0 4 0
  mptransfer $n 15075
  break
endif
if quest(0, 4, $n) == 1
  if sex($n) == 1
    say Welcome High Lord.  I am Your Court Wizard, and I
  else
    say Welcome High Lady.  I am Your Court Wizard, and I
  endif
  say am at your disposal.  You are the thirty-third in a
  say long line of kings, so you will have to establish
  say yourself before your crown is challenged.  There are
  say many people that may back your claim, but I suggest
  say you start with Lord Kallendbor in Ryhndweir.
  mpmset $n quest 0 4 2
else
  if quest(0, 4, $n) == 4
    say Congratulations on your defeat of Kallendbor.  You
    say are well on your way towards becoming a king in fact
    say as well as name.  The next person I suggest you talk
    say to is the River Master in the lake country.
    mpmset $n quest 0 4 5
  else
    if quest(0, 4, $n) == 6
      say You have won a concession from the River Master.  It
      say is hope though in truth the task seems daunting.  You
      say had best go see Nightshade now.  She resides in Deep Fell.
    else
      if quest(0, 4, $n) == 7
        say You survived your encounter with Nightshade, a victory
        say in itself.  If you succeed in gaining control of Strabo,
        say all the powerhouses in the kingdom will bow down to you.
      else
        if quest(0, 4, $n) == 9
          say Good and Bad news has arrived since I last saw you.
          say The good news is that the River Master has given his consent
          if sex($n) == 1
            say for his daughter to marry you.  The bad news is that the
          else
            say for his son to marry you.  The bad news is that the 
          endif
          say wedding will have to wait, for the Iron Mark has been seen in
          say the kingdom.  It is rumored that when all the kingdom meets
          say at the Heart for your coronation, The Mark will be there to 
          say kill you.  If you manage to kill the mark, then you will gain
          if sex($n) == 1
            say both a kingdom and a wife
          else
            say both a kingdom and a husband
          endif
          mpmset $n quest 0 4 10
        else
          bow $n
        endif
      endif
    endif
  endif
endif
endif
~
>speech_prog landsview~
say You may use the landsview to view parts of Landover
say from this castle.  Just say the name of the place you
say want to view and the landsview will do the rest.
~
>speech_prog p Deep Fell~
if quest(0, 4, $n) == 12
  mptransfer all 15028
  mpat 15028 mpforce $n look
endif
~
>speech_prog p Fire Springs~
if quest(0, 4, $n) == 12
  mptransfer all 15068
  mpat 15068 mpforce $n look 
endif
~
>speech_prog p Ryhndweir~
if quest(0, 4, $n) == 12
  mptransfer all 15061
  mpat 15061 mpforce $n look
endif
~
