#15016
heart~
Heart~
The heart~
The heart~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_ETHEREAL
0 S
1 0 0 1d1+28 1d1+9
1 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if quest(0, 4, $n) == 10
  mpechoat $n All of the prominent figures in the kingdom have appeared
  mpechoat $n for you coronation.  Unfortunately one of those figures is 
  mpechoat $n the Iron Mark.  As The Mark spies you and couches his lance to
  mpechoat $n charge, you grasp your medallion and begin to wish that the
  mpechoat $n Paladin, champion of the king of Landover, that you have heard
  mpechoat $n were here to protect you from this Demon that is charging you.
  mpechoat $n All of a sudden you feel yourself enclosed in the armor of that
  mpechoat $n that very Paladin.  You feel his strength and bloodlust course
  mpechoat $n through you and you know that you will Win this battle!
  mpmload 15002
  rescale 15002 $n 100
  mpforce $n shout I am the Paladin, and I will save Landover from the Mark!
  mpforce themarkquestmob mpkill $n
endif
~
>rand_prog 100~
if quest(0, 4, $r) == 11
  mpecho The guests return to the heart once The Mark is dead.
  mpechoat $r The guests decide that you are most interested in is the River Master's
  if sex($r) == 1
    mpechoat $r daughter, Willow, for you have decided to add a wedding to the
  else
    mpechoat $r son, Birch, for you have decided to add a wedding to the
  endif
  mpechoat $r days list of events as well as a coronation.
  if sex($r) == 1
    mpmload 15018
    mpforce willow follow $r
  else
    mpmload 15019
    mpforce birch follow $r
  endif
  mpechoat $r Both the wedding and the coronation go without another hitch
  mpechoat $r and your subjects sing your praises eternally.
  if sex($r) == 1
    mpmset $r long High Lord $n of Landover.
  else
    mpmset $r long High Lady $n of Landover.
  endif
  mpmset $r quest 0 4 12
endif
~
