#15000
Rosen's Store~
You enter a small shop that caters to a wide range of needs.  It is
situated on a well traveled section of road, and as such get many
customers.  On the shelves lining the walls of the shop, you see almost
any item that you can imagine, and many that you can't.  Stairs lead up
from here.  A short man sits behind the counter reading something.~
