#15071
King's Bedroom~
This is a vast chamber of tapestries and silken hangings, of polished oak
and heraldic stone sculptures.  A great canopied bed of oak and iron looks
as though it might successfully double as a barge.~
150 ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_NO_RECALL|ROOM_SAFE SECT_INN
