#15072
Dining Hall~
You enter a cavernous dining hall with a huge tressel table and high-backed 
chairs cushioned in scarlet silk.  Chandeliers of tarnished silver hung from 
the ceiling; despite the summer weather, a fire burns in the hearth at the
far end of the hall.~
150 ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_NO_RECALL SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_NORTH
Great Hall~
~
0 -1 15070
S
#15074
Landsview~
You enter a small circular room.  The wall before you opens halfway around 
from floor to ceiling into clouds of mist that swirl pas the towers of the 
castle as they rise darkly against the coming night.  A silver guardrail on 
stanchions curves at waist height across the opening.  A silver lectern is 
fastened at its mid-point.~
150 ROOM_NO_RECALL SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_DOWN
Great Hall~
~
