#15075
Meeks' Office~
You are in a small cramped office.  Just about every inch of floor space is 
covered with what looks to be old stock from the store below.  A desk is
crammed into the corner and behind that desk sits an old man.~
150 ROOM_INDOORS|ROOM_PRIVATE|ROOM_NO_RECALL SECT_INSIDE
